{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_011_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9d27a6e85716d32f7c09c8ec2be1cb27bde5f7a7ff251c3ce6a5ec50b73c7c4f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5888e6c13f50f7075c27c3f1f5a565a35353c703f60faec8b1a78d08f61b758",
      "text": "这个巧克力……难道是给我的？谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76090713a23aea383c8c8ac91aedbe1539f6ee75adc072a142a55a5f2878e2ec",
      "text": "能收到情人节巧克力，真开心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5c5404d4940be117213ad8c1bc96579793787fd699c89188b8df8a43efdbdb5",
      "text": "而且还是平时一直关照我的 ●●●●プロデューサー送的，就更开心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d43956b6c19d54fd796dde48ce8fbf1a793aa0dd3eed0c702dfea4a716b83ed",
      "text": "看起来是能让人充满元气的巧克力呢。工作之前吃掉吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca6a2adf8db6f61da1bafe864724f8f696748fd5e08ce8eb0419e13056853af6",
      "text": "我会好好回礼的。敬请期待白色情人节吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8259d833e8bf7fdbc1f29fa988970592562e63dd7db7dd42ed5009dea36bdcd2",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦。这个巧克力……呵呵，是给我的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7435f3f5c5362ddca90963db8fd369ef05e8f0d03f4a5398ec3403d2a1abaa8",
      "text": "谢谢你，我非常开心哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1061bc196eca661d244aabf27d486b6b9950d8371b8486ff4c1f2822d17c4980",
      "text": "像这样收到巧克力，总觉得有种特别的感觉，真好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d208c6d741d5cf4c07bd43ec43cb94244fe12daeb71a01adc198bb575d7c88d",
      "text": "这份巧克力里一定装满了 ●●●●プロデューサー的心意吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c370f6bb2a68402e8bdf0f3b4400f14cd6c30bb49284e70363d2d39b8f29b11b",
      "text": "我也想把从你这里收到的心意回馈给你呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4a212e2cf6346d368887949c9e339e6a64c217c4b6ecd171a4477ce63db0d96",
      "text": "好好期待白色情人节吧。我一定会让你开心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000039:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbdefa806d8dfa30c52cddc1f14d15348567455bf4274b7878a0c1615f35a376",
      "text": "非常感谢。我很期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000040:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec04b66d2362a626ada4cbaf785c8eb9829297ba5038962759c2248a09a5f71a",
      "text": "真的吗？那我就好好期待了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:417d210bdcacc16c4f1fcb68caca0d3af3947eb80e8857c7c9400d29871a0cb3",
      "text": "嗯，等着我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee6265a6ad3c018ea9729e9543215275836b415a40fc43419e3a0176dd460f86",
      "text": "嗯！你可以好好期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_011_22:5_01_011_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:947bf1dfae56a7bf76502d286747411f2c66896f8ec6f01306880699bbabe0f5",
      "text": "我向你保证，一定会为●●●●プロデューサー 准备一份珍藏的特别回礼的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
